<div class="wrap page-head"><p class="kicker">CEO and lead wardrobe consultant</p><h1>Halie</h1><p class="lede">The face of the brand and the creative force behind it. Halie launched The Urban Sophisticate Collective on January 1, 2025, out of a passion for styling and the belief that high street and high fashion pieces can coexist.</p></div>
<section class="band" style="padding-top:1.5rem">
  <div class="wrap two-col top">
    <img src="/images/halie-lipstick-hero.jpg" alt="Halie applying red lipstick in a navy blazer and striped tie" width="1206" height="1506">
    <div class="prose">
      <p>She specializes in more than pret-a-porter wardrobing; vintage pieces and custom designs are essential to what she offers. Her styling began years ago, fueled by a passion for fashion and an appreciation for the unconventional, and her knowledge of brands has made her a reliable authority. Modeling is what first sparked her interest in wardrobing, since she styled her own looks on set.</p>
      <p>She has worked with individuals going through life changes, athletes, and professionals from major industries, and has been collecting vintage and vinyl since 2008.</p>
      <p>She is a Dalmatian gal and loves her pup, Oakley, named after the neighborhood in Cincinnati. She is a true foodie with a penchant for niche restaurants; ask her about styling and she may also point you to the best dinner in town.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:2rem"><a class="btn" href="/contact/">Work with Halie</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="band paper" id="the-name">
  <div class="wrap two-col top">
    <div>
      <p class="kicker">Why the name</p>
      <h2>What an urban sophisticate is</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>Not a label, and not a budget. An urban sophisticate is someone who knows their city, has range, and dresses like they mean it. Vintage next to this season's drop, a tailored jacket over sneakers, high street and high fashion in the same look, and the confidence to carry it. They know where to eat, what to hear, and what actually works off the runway.</p>
      <p>That is who we style, and who we help people become. The collective is the circle around it: clients, vintage dealers, tailors, and the shops we trust in Cincinnati.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
